+## Cleanup and recovery
+
+Use these checks when a candidate run gets messy:
+
+| Problem | Recovery |
+| --- | --- |
+| Candidate worktree has uncommitted scratch changes | Inspect with `git -C <worktree> status`, save useful notes, then commit or discard before removal. |
+| Worktree directory was deleted manually | Run `git worktree prune` from the source checkout. |
+| Evaluator cannot compare candidates | Require each candidate to fill `artifacts/notes.md`, `artifacts/quality-gates.txt`, and `artifacts/status.toml` before judging. |
+| PR creation fails after promotion | Keep the pushed branch, fix authentication, then create/update the PR without rerunning candidates. |
+
 ## Current limits
 
 - The script prepares and records workflow artifacts; it does not launch provider-specific coding agents.
